<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>의정이슈레이더 | 17개 시·도의회 정책 시공간 확산 및 미래 예측</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0fdf4',
                            100: '#dcfce7',
                            500: '#10b981',
                            600: '#059669',
                            DEFAULT: '#0284c7'
                        },
                        radar: {
                            dark: '#0a0d14',
                            panel: '#111726',
                            border: '#1f293d',
                            highlight: '#38bdf8',
                            coral: '#f43f5e',
                            amber: '#f59e0b',
                            emerald: '#10b981',
                            indigo: '#6366f1'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Pretendard', '-apple-system', 'BlinkMacSystemFont', 'system-ui', 'Roboto', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', 'sans-serif'],
                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Consolas', 'monospace']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- FontAwesome 6 -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Pretendard & JetBrains Mono Fonts -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Leaflet CSS & JS for Interactive Carto Positron Map (final_app style) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=" crossorigin="" />
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script>

    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        html {
            font-size: 18px; /* 기본 18px 스케일 (보통 폰트 가독성 확대) */
            transition: font-size 0.2s ease;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f1f5f9; /* 고대비 밝은 슬레이트 배경 */
            color: #0f172a; /* 최고 대비 딥 네이비 텍스트 */
            overflow-x: hidden;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.65;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
        }



        /* Light Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #e2e8f0; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #94a3b8; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #0284c7; }

        /* Light Theme Card Panels */
        .glass-panel {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
        }
        .glass-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
        }

        /* High Visibility Animated Diffusion Arcs */
        @keyframes flowGlow {
            0% { stroke-dashoffset: 100; opacity: 0.6; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
            100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 0.6; }
        }
        .flow-line {
            stroke-dasharray: 8 6;
            animation: flowGlow 2.5s linear infinite;
        }

        /* Leaflet & Carto Positron Custom Theme */
        .leaflet-container {
            background-color: #f6f5f1 !important;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif !important;
        }
        .leaflet-control-zoom {
            border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1 !important;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08) !important;
            border-radius: 10px !important;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .leaflet-control-zoom a {
            background-color: #ffffff !important;
            color: #1e293b !important;
            font-weight: 900 !important;
            transition: all 0.15s ease !important;
        }
        .leaflet-control-zoom a:hover {
            background-color: #f1f5f9 !important;
            color: #0284c7 !important;
        }

        /* Final App Tooltip (Dark Olive Sage Theme: #393e2e, 1.5배 확대 및 반응형 스케일) */
        .leaflet-tooltip.final-app-tooltip {
            background: #393e2e !important;
            color: #fffaf0 !important;
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) !important;
            border-radius: 12px !important;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45) !important;
            padding: 0 !important;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif !important;
            line-height: 1.55 !important;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease-out;
        }
        .leaflet-tooltip-top.final-app-tooltip:before {
            border-top-color: #393e2e !important;
            border-width: 8px 8px 0 !important;
            margin-left: -8px !important;
        }
        .leaflet-tooltip-bottom.final-app-tooltip:before {
            border-bottom-color: #393e2e !important;
            border-width: 0 8px 8px !important;
            margin-left: -8px !important;
        }

        /* Final App Council Node Markers (ScatterplotLayer + TextLayer) */
        .custom-council-divicon {
            background: transparent !important;
            border: none !important;
        }
        .council-marker-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            user-select: none;
        }
        .council-marker-wrapper:hover {
            transform: scale(1.18);
            z-index: 1000 !important;
        }
        .council-node-circle {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background: #e95b4c; /* final_app coral fill */
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
            border: 2.5px solid #fff9ee; /* final_app line color */
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(233, 91, 76, 0.5);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .council-marker-wrapper.is-origin .council-node-circle {
            background: #f59e0b;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35), 0 3px 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.55);
        }
        .council-marker-wrapper.is-selected .council-node-circle {
            background: #0284c7;
            border-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.45), 0 4px 18px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.65);
            transform: scale(1.15);
        }
        .council-marker-wrapper.is-predict .council-node-circle {
            background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.9);
            border: 2px dashed #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.35);
            animation: pulsePredict 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        .council-pill-label {
            margin-top: 3px;
            padding: 2px 7px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            color: #334155;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            white-space: nowrap;
            pointer-events: none;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .council-marker-wrapper.is-selected .council-pill-label {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #ffffff;
            border-color: #0f172a;
        }
        @keyframes pulsePredict {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.5); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0); }
        }

        /* Arc Overlay SVG Styling */
        .arc-line-path {
            fill: none;
            stroke-linecap: round;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgba(238, 94, 76, 0.35));
        }
        .arc-moving-orb {
            filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 4px rgba(238, 94, 76, 0.6));
        }

        /* Map Node Hover */
        .map-node {
            transition: filter 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .map-node:hover {
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 10px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.5));
        }

        #policyTooltip {
            pointer-events: auto;
            transition: opacity 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
            transform: translate(-50%, -100%);
            z-index: 100;
        }

        /* Light Theme High Affordance Tabs */
        .tab-btn {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            color: #334155;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 9px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            user-select: none;
            position: relative;
        }
        .tab-btn:hover {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-color: #0284c7;
            color: #0284c7;
            transform: translateY(-1.5px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);
        }
        .tab-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0.5px);
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
        }
        .tab-btn.active {
            background: #0284c7;
            border-color: #0284c7;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.35);
        }
        .tab-btn.active span[class*="rounded"] {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) !important;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) !important;
        }
        .tab-btn.active i {
            color: #ffffff !important;
        }

        /* Floating Chatbot Pulse Glow */
        @keyframes chatFloatGlow {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.6); }
            70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(2, 132, 199, 0); }
        }
        .floating-chat-btn {
            animation: chatFloatGlow 3s infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-sky-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- Top Navigation Header -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white border-b-2 border-slate-300 px-4 lg:px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between shadow-sm">
        <!-- Logo & Branding -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3.5 shrink-0">
            <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-sky-600 via-indigo-600 to-rose-500 p-0.5 shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/20">
                <div class="w-full h-full bg-sky-50 rounded-[10px] flex items-center justify-center border border-sky-200">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-satellite-dish text-sky-700 text-xl animate-pulse"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 to-indigo-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">TEAM 꺼드럭's · KISTI 경진대회</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-base md:text-lg font-black text-slate-950 flex items-center gap-1.5 leading-tight tracking-tight mt-0.5">
                    의정이슈레이더 <span class="text-slate-700 font-bold text-xs md:text-sm hidden sm:inline">| 17개 시·도의회 정책 시공간 확산 및 미래 예측</span>
                </h1>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 단일 통합 메인 검색창 (중복 드롭다운 완전 제거) -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 max-w-xl w-full mx-4 justify-center">
            <div class="relative w-full">
                <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 flex items-center pl-3.5 text-slate-700 text-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i>
                </span>
                <input type="text" id="globalSearchInput" placeholder="정책 이슈 검색 (예: 전세사기, 늘봄학교, 전기차 화재, 지역 소멸)" class="w-full pl-10 pr-16 py-2.5 bg-white border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-sm md:text-base text-slate-950 placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-sky-600 font-bold transition-all shadow-sm">
                <button onclick="handleGlobalSearch()" class="absolute right-1.5 top-1.5 bottom-1.5 px-3.5 bg-sky-700 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white rounded-lg text-xs md:text-sm font-black transition-all shadow-sm">
                    분석
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 우측 액션: 폰트 크기 조절 옵션 & 테마 전환 -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 shrink-0">
            <!-- 글자 크기 3단계 조절 버튼 (작게 / 보통 / 크게) -->
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 p-1 rounded-xl shadow-inner text-xs">
                <span class="text-slate-700 pl-2 pr-1 flex items-center gap-1 font-bold">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-text-height text-sky-700"></i>
                    <span class="hidden md:inline">글자 크기</span>
                </span>
                <button onclick="setFontScale('small')" id="btnFont-small" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition-all font-bold cursor-pointer">작게</button>
                <button onclick="setFontScale('normal')" id="btnFont-normal" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-sky-700 text-white font-black shadow-sm transition-all cursor-pointer">보통</button>
                <button onclick="setFontScale('large')" id="btnFont-large" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition-all font-bold cursor-pointer">크게</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Navigation Tabs (카테고리 순서 조정: 10대 대표 키워드를 맨 앞으로 재배치) -->
    <nav class="bg-white border-b-2 border-slate-300 px-4 lg:px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-3 overflow-x-auto text-sm shrink-0 select-none shadow-sm">
        <!-- TAB 1: 10대 대표 키워드/이슈 (TOP 10) (화면 맨 왼쪽/맨 앞 배치) -->
        <button onclick="switchTab('catalog')" id="tab-catalog" class="tab-btn active shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-amber-700 text-sm"></i>
            <span>10대 대표 키워드 (TOP 10)</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 border border-amber-300">트렌드</span>
        </button>

        <!-- TAB 2: 정책 시공간 전파 레이더 대시보드 -->
        <button onclick="switchTab('radar')" id="tab-radar" class="tab-btn shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-sm"></i>
            <span>정책 시공간 전파 레이더</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-sky-100 text-sky-900 border border-sky-300">상세 분석</span>
        </button>

        <!-- TAB 3: 근거 원문 상세 검색 -->
        <button onclick="switchTab('search')" id="tab-search" class="tab-btn shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines text-purple-700 text-sm"></i>
            <span>근거 원문 상세 검색</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 border border-purple-300">회의록 원문</span>
        </button>
    </nav>

    <!-- Top KPI Metric Cards (정책 시공간 전파 레이더 탭 활성화 시에만 노출) -->
    <section id="radarKpiSection" class="px-4 lg:px-6 pt-3.5 pb-1 shrink-0 hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 max-w-[1800px] mx-auto">
            <!-- 1. 전국 확산 현황 (관측의회 수) -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-sky-500 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between bg-white">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider block">전국 광역의회 확산도</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-normal">(관측의회 수)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2 mt-1">
                        <span id="kpiCouncilCount" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-sky-800">12 / 17곳</span>
                        <span id="kpiCouncilRatio" class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-950 bg-sky-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-sky-300 font-bold">70.6%</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-600 block mt-1">※ 전체 17개 시·도의회 중 1회 이상 발언·논의된 의회 수</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 border border-sky-300 text-sky-800 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. 신뢰 검증 근거 발언수 -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-emerald-500 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between bg-white">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider block">신뢰 검증 근거 발언수</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-emerald-950 bg-emerald-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-300 font-bold">공식 정제</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2 mt-1">
                        <span id="kpiEvidenceCount" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-emerald-800">1,234 건</span>
                    </div>
                    <span id="kpiDataRange" class="text-xs text-slate-600 block mt-1">※ 2024.01 ~ 2025.12 본회의·상임위 회의록 정제 청크</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-300 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. 공공데이터 결합 차기 예측 1위 의회 -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-rose-500 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between bg-white">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider block">데이터 결합 차기 확산 예측</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-rose-800 font-mono font-bold bg-rose-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-rose-200">1순위</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2 mt-1">
                        <span id="kpiTopPredictedCouncil" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-black text-rose-800">전라남도의회</span>
                        <span id="kpiPredDays" class="text-xs text-rose-800 font-mono font-black">향후 45일 내</span>
                    </div>
                    <span id="kpiPredReason" class="text-xs text-slate-600 truncate max-w-[280px] block mt-1">자치법규 3건 발의 + 소멸지수 고위험 지역</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-rose-100 border border-rose-300 text-rose-800 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Container Body -->
    <main class="flex-1 px-4 lg:px-6 py-3 max-w-[1800px] w-full mx-auto space-y-4">

        <!-- ========================================================================================= -->
        <!-- TAB 1: 🔥 10대 대표 키워드/이슈 (TOP 10) (화면 맨 왼쪽/맨 앞 기본 활성화) -->
        <!-- ========================================================================================= -->
        <div id="tabContent-catalog" class="tab-content flex flex-col space-y-4">
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 p-5 shadow-sm bg-white">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-3 mb-3">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-amber-700"></i>
                            <span>10대 대표 정책 키워드 (TOP 10)</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-700 mt-1 font-medium">
                            전국 17개 시·도의회 회의록 빅데이터 중 정책적 파급력과 신뢰도 검증을 마친 10대 핵심 의제입니다. <b>'레이더 보기'</b>를 클릭하여 시공간 전파 지도를 즉시 분석할 수 있습니다.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 text-amber-950 border border-amber-300 font-bold shadow-sm">
                        10 Master Issues
                    </span>
                </div>

                <!-- 10 Issues Table (불필요한 최초발원지, 복잡한 예측 퍼센티지/언급량 삭제 및 간소화) -->
                <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                    <table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-slate-900">
                        <thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 text-xs md:text-sm uppercase font-mono border-b-2 border-slate-300 font-bold">
                            <tr>
                                <th class="p-3 w-20">ID</th>
                                <th class="p-3">10대 정책 핵심 키워드</th>
                                <th class="p-3 w-32">최초 관측일</th>
                                <th class="p-3 w-40">관측 의회 수 (전국 확산)</th>
                                <th class="p-3 w-36">총 근거 건수</th>
                                <th class="p-3 text-center w-36">레이더 분석</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="catalogTableBody" class="divide-y divide-slate-200">
                            <!-- Populated dynamically by JS -->
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <!-- 지표 및 범례 설명 보완 카드 -->
                <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed">
                    <div class="font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-sky-700"></i>
                        <span>지표 및 용어 안내</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-800"><b>· 관측 의회 수:</b> 전체 17개 시·도의회 중 해당 정책 현안이 1회 이상 공식 회의록(본회의·상임위)에서 발언·심의된 의회 수입니다.</p>
                    <p class="text-slate-800"><b>· 총 근거 건수:</b> 전국 시·도의회 회의록 빅데이터 중 형태소 분석 및 의미 벡터 검증을 통과한 신뢰도 높은 원문 발언 청크 수입니다.</p>
                    <p class="text-slate-800"><b>· 레이더 보기:</b> 행을 클릭하거나 '레이더 보기' 버튼을 누르면 해당 정책 키워드의 17개 광역의회 시공간 전파 동역학 지도와 상세 발언 회의록 화면으로 즉시 전환됩니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ========================================================================================= -->
        <!-- TAB 2: 📍 정책 시공간 전파 레이더 (상세 분석 대시보드) -->
        <!-- ========================================================================================= -->
        <div id="tabContent-radar" class="tab-content hidden grid grid-cols-12 gap-3.5">
            <!-- 비등록 검색어의 동적 상세 분석 결과 영역 -->
            <section id="dynamicAnalysisResultsContainer" class="col-span-12 space-y-4" aria-live="polite"></section>
            <!-- LLM 기반 향후 정책 전망 브리핑 카드 (상단 영역 확대 배치) -->
            <div class="col-span-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50/90 via-white to-sky-50/90 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-500/60 p-4.5 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-200/80 pb-2 mb-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 animate-ping"></span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-black tracking-wider text-amber-900 uppercase">AI POLICY FORECAST · 정책 확산 및 향후 논의 전망</span>
                    </div>
                    <span id="forecastCategoryBadge" class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-950 border border-amber-300">
                        인구/균형발전
                    </span>
                </div>
                <h3 id="forecastHeadline" class="text-base md:text-lg font-black text-slate-950 mb-1 leading-snug">
                    비수도권 거점도시 중심 청년 정주여건 개선 및 지방소멸대응기금 연계 조례 집중 논의 전망
                </h3>
                <p id="forecastDescription" class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                    수도권에서 최초 관측된 해당 현안은 강원·대전·경북 등 전국 12개 광역의회로 활발히 확산되었으며, 향후 전남·광주·전북 등 소멸위험 고위험 지역을 중심으로 자치법규 제정 및 후속 심의가 가속화될 가능성이 높습니다.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-600">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-700">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600"></i>
                        <span id="forecastReasonText">자치법규(조례 제정 발의 건수) 및 통계청 인구이동지표 결합 분석 결과</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="font-mono text-slate-500 font-bold">17개 광역의회 회의록 전파 동역학 분석</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Left 7 Cols: High-Precision Interactive Korea Diffusion Map & Timeline Story Player -->
            <section class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col glass-panel rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 overflow-hidden shadow-sm relative min-h-[580px]">
                <!-- Map Header & Current Time Display (final_app style) -->
                <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-300 flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-50 shrink-0">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-sm md:text-base font-black text-slate-950 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot text-[#eb604f]"></i>
                            <span>대한민국 지역별 최초 관측 흐름</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium mt-0.5">
                            연결선은 시간적 관측 순서이며 정책의 인과적 전달 경로가 아닙니다.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Map Status Badges & Controls -->
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <span id="mapCurrentStepDate" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 text-sky-950 border border-sky-300 shadow-sm">
                            2024-01-15 (최초 관측)
                        </span>
                        <button onclick="resetMapView()" title="대한민국 전체 보기 / 뷰 초기화" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 p-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 border border-slate-300 text-xs font-black transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate text-xs text-slate-600"></i>
                            <span class="hidden sm:inline">전국 보기</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Interactive Carto Positron Map Canvas Area (final_app style with zoom & pan) -->
                <div id="mapViewport" class="flex-1 relative w-full h-[540px] min-h-[500px] bg-[#f6f5f1] overflow-hidden select-none">
                    <!-- Leaflet Interactive Carto Positron Map Container -->
                    <div id="koreaLeafletMap" class="w-full h-full relative z-10"></div>

                    <!-- Map Legend Overlay (final_app style) -->
                    <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md text-slate-900 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 shadow-xl text-xs space-y-2 z-[500]">
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 border-b border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                            <span class="font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-[#eb604f]"></i>
                                <span>관측 흐름 범례</span>
                            </span>
                            <span id="cartoEnvBadge" class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-spinner animate-spin text-[9px]"></i>CARTO (.env 확인 중)
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b] border-2 border-white shadow-sm text-[10px] font-black text-white flex items-center justify-center font-mono">1</span>
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">최초 관측 의회</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#e95b4c] border-2 border-white shadow-sm text-[10px] font-black text-white flex items-center justify-center font-mono">2~</span>
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">후속 전파 의회</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <div class="w-5 h-2 rounded bg-gradient-to-r from-[#69704f] to-[#ee5e4c]"></div>
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-700">시간적 관측 연결선</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-rose-500 bg-rose-500/20 text-[9px] font-black text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center font-mono">Next</span>
                            <span class="font-bold text-rose-700">차기 예측 의회</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pt-1 border-t border-slate-200 text-[10px] text-slate-600 flex items-center gap-1">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-plus text-sky-700"></i>
                            <span>휠/버튼 확대·축소 & 드래그 탐색</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Map Legal Attribution (OpenStreetMap & CARTO Attribution Rule) -->
                    <div class="absolute bottom-2 right-2.5 z-[400] bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] text-slate-500 border border-slate-300/60 shadow-2xs font-sans select-text pointer-events-auto leading-none">
                        © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-900 font-semibold hover:underline">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors,
                        © <a href="https://carto.com/attribution/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-900 font-semibold hover:underline">CARTO</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Bottom Timeline Story Player Controller -->
                <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-col space-y-2.5 shrink-0">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs md:text-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                            <span class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-slate-800">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-sky-700 text-sm"></i>
                                <span class="font-black text-slate-950 text-sm md:text-base">타임라인 스토리플레이어</span>
                            </span>
                            <span id="playerStateText" class="text-sky-900 font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold bg-sky-100 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-sky-300">
                                탐색 준비 완료
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-700 font-mono flex items-center space-x-2 font-bold">
                            <span id="playerSpeedText">속도: 1.3s</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-400">|</span>
                            <span>전체 <span id="totalStepCount" class="font-black text-sky-700">7</span>단계</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Controls and Slider Bar -->
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3.5">
                        <button onclick="toggleTimelinePlay()" id="playToggleBtn" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-700 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-md transition-all active:scale-95 shrink-0 cursor-pointer">
                            <i id="playToggleIcon" class="fa-solid fa-play text-sm"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="stepTimeline(-1)" title="이전 의회" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-backward-step text-xs"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="stepTimeline(1)" title="다음 의회" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-forward-step text-xs"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="resetTimelineToStart()" title="처음으로" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300 transition-colors shrink-0 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left text-xs"></i>
                        </button>
                        <div class="flex-1 flex items-center relative">
                            <input type="range" id="timelineSlider" min="0" max="6" value="0" step="1" oninput="onTimelineSliderChange(this.value)" class="w-full accent-sky-700 h-2.5 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                        </div>
                        <span id="timelineEndDate" class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-800 font-black shrink-0">2025.12</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Right 5 Cols: [통합] 선택 의회 핵심 요약 + 앞뒤 전체 문맥(Parent Context) 일체형 상세 카드 -->
            <section class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col space-y-3.5">
                <!-- TOP CARD: [선택 의회 상세 정보 & 회의록 전체 문맥 통합 뷰] -->
                <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl border-2 border-sky-600/40 p-4.5 flex-1 flex flex-col shadow-md bg-white">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 border border-sky-300 text-sky-800 flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-waveform text-base"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <h3 id="detailCouncilName" class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">서울특별시의회</h3>
                                    <span id="detailOrderBadge" class="text-xs font-black px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 border border-amber-300 shadow-sm">
                                        1번째 관측
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                                <p id="detailStageText" class="text-xs md:text-sm text-amber-800 font-extrabold mt-0.5">
                                    최초 관측 (시차 0일)
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1 font-mono">
                            <span id="detailMentionBadge" class="text-xs font-black px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-sky-100 text-sky-950 border border-sky-300 shadow-sm">
                                언급 168건
                            </span>
                            <span id="detailSimilarity" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800">
                                신뢰도 94%
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Excerpt Detail & Parent Context Unified View (한 줄 요약과 앞뒤 문맥을 하나로 통합) -->
                    <div class="space-y-3 text-xs md:text-sm overflow-y-auto pr-1 max-h-[380px]">
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-3 border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-800 font-medium">
                                <span class="font-black text-slate-950 flex items-center gap-1">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check text-sky-700"></i>
                                    <span>관측 일시 및 시차</span>
                                </span>
                                <span id="detailMeetingDate" class="font-mono text-sky-800 font-black">2024-01-15 (+0일)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div id="detailMeetingName" class="text-sm font-black text-slate-950 leading-snug">
                                제315회 서울특별시의회(임시회) 기획경제위원회 제1차 회의록
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-0.5 text-xs text-slate-700 font-bold">
                                <span><b>발언자:</b> <span id="detailSpeaker" class="text-slate-950 font-black">김영수 의원</span></span>
                                <span>|</span>
                                <span><b>안건:</b> <span id="detailAgenda" class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">청년인구 유출 대책 수립 건</span></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 통합된 회의록 발언 요약 및 앞뒤 전체 대화 문맥 (Parent Context 아코디언) -->
                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50/70 p-3.5 space-y-2.5 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-sky-200/80 pb-1.5">
                                <span class="font-black text-sky-950 text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left text-sky-700"></i>
                                    <span>핵심 발언 및 앞뒤 전체 회의록 문맥 (Parent Context)</span>
                                </span>
                                <button type="button" onclick="toggleDetailContextAccordion()" id="btnDetailContextAccordion" class="text-xs text-sky-800 hover:text-sky-950 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-sky-300 shadow-2xs hover:bg-sky-50 transition-colors">
                                    <span id="accordionText">앞뒤 문맥 접기</span>
                                    <i id="accordionIcon" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-up text-[10px]"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- 핵심 발언 하이라이트 -->
                            <div id="detailExcerptText" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-sky-200 shadow-2xs leading-relaxed italic">
                                "지방소멸 위기에 따른 수도권-지방 간 청년 인구 이동 양극화 현상을 분석하고, 상생 협력 및 연계 지원책 수립을 위한 기초 조례안에 대해 논의를 진행하였습니다."
                            </div>

                            <!-- 앞뒤 전체 문맥 대화 흐름 -->
                            <div id="detailParentContext" class="p-3 bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-mono whitespace-pre-line max-h-[180px] overflow-y-auto">
                                [위원장]: 다음 안건으로 수도권-지방 상생 균형발전 특별위원회가 상정한 청년 인구 유출 관련 조례 개정안을 심사하겠습니다. 김영수 의원 질의해 주십시오.
                                [김영수 의원]: 본 의원이 제출한 자료에 따르면 수도권 집중화는 서울의 청년 주거난과 지방의 인구소멸 고위험군 확대를 동시에 부르고 있습니다. 서울시 차원에서도 지방소멸대응기금 연계 상생 사업에 적극 출연해야 합니다.
                                [기획조정실장]: 의원님 지적에 동감하며, 충청 및 영호남 거점 도시들과 연계한 청년 일자리 순환 프로그램을 적극 검토하겠습니다.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
